Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Waleed Hussein and the Tourney contributors

Tourney began in 2024 as a six-person university course project, across the
repositories `tourney-frontend` and `tourney-backend`. Both histories are
preserved in this repository, and the original authors — Waleed Hussein,
Haytham Duwaji, Jad Zeid, Hamza Matar, Jad El Murr, and Soumi — retain
authorship of their commits. Version 2.0 is a solo rewrite by Waleed Hussein.

